Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): reference for the multi-axis, probing and plasma
 operations

One section per multi-axis kind in the registry (5-Axis Contour, 5-Axis
Parallel, 5-Axis Flow, Multi-Axis Contour, Swarf, Advanced Swarf, Rotary
Contour, Rotary Parallel, Rotary Offset, Multi-Axis Rough) with the shared
pose trio, shank avoidance, the in-air swing rule and the machine's reach
check; a Probe page (picks, tabs, what the post writes, the stylus guards);
a Plasma Profile page (kerf, direction, leads, small holes, the plasma
table, torch and post it needs, and the plasma laws). Linked from the
operations page.

Refs #1250

